e": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2417015, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202605/t20260509_2206019.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202605/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2205598, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "惠企政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202605/t20260507_2205598.htm", "content": "　　为认真落实党中央、国务院部署，用好科技创新和技术改造再贷款，激励引导金融机构进一步加强对科技创新和大规模设备更新的金融服务，近日，中国人民银行、国家发展改革委、财政部联合印发《关于扩大科技创新和技", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202605/t20260507_2205598.htm", "docreltime": "2026.05.07 08:33:00", "doctitle": "中国人民银行 国家发展改革委 财政部联合印发《关于扩大科技创新和技术改造贷款投放 进一步支持设备更新的通知》", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2416502, "sourcename": "国家发展改革委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202605/t20260507_2205598.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202605/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2200660, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "惠企政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202604/t20260407_2200660.htm", "content": "各有关单位：\n　　按照省委、省政府工作部署，深入推行成果转化“揭榜挂帅”机制，吸引更多高质量的科技成果在我省转化落地，推动科技创新与产业创新深度融合。经研究，决定面向全国范围内高等院校、科研院所（含省创", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202604/t20260407_2200660.htm", "docreltime": "2026.04.07 17:02:00", "doctitle": "福建省科学技术厅关于征集2026年度省“揭榜挂帅”成果转化项目需求的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2410618, "sourcename": "三明市气象局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202604/t20260407_2200660.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "闽科平函〔2026〕4号及附件.docx", "appdocid": 2200660, "appfile": "P020260407614704494348.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202604/t20260407_2200660.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202604/P020260407/P020260407614704494348.docx", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202604/P020260407614704494348.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202604/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2197464, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "惠企政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202603/t20260330_2197464.htm", "content": "各设区市工信局、财政局，平潭综合实验区经发局、财政金融局：\n　　经省政府同意，现将修订后的《福建省首台（套）技术装备评定和扶持管理办法》印发给你们，请遵照执行。\n　　福建省工业和信息化厅    ", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202603/t20260330_2197464.htm", "docreltime": "2026.03.30 08:30:00", "doctitle": "福建省工业和信息化厅 福建省财政厅关于印发《福建省首台（套）技术装备评定和扶持管理办法》的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2407169, "sourcename": "福建省人民政府门户网", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202603/t20260330_2197464.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202603/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2196127, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "惠企政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202603/t20260324_2196127.htm", "content": "　　近日，工业和信息化部、国家发展改革委、国务院国资委、国家能源局等四部门联合印发《节能装备高质量发展实施方案（2026—2028年）》（工信部联节〔2026〕44号，以下简称《实施方案》），持续提升通用性强、用能", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202603/t20260324_2196127.htm", "docreltime": "2026.03.24 08:17:00", "doctitle": "四部门联合印发《节能装备高质量发展实施方案（2026—2028年）》", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2405720, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202603/t20260324_2196127.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202603/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2194542, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "惠企政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202603/t20260316_2194542.htm", "content": "各市、县（区）人民政府，平潭综合实验区管委会，省人民政府各部门、各直属机构，各大企业，各高等院校：\n　　《关于加力促进中小微企业高质量发展若干措施》已经省政府同意，现印发给你们，请认真组织实施。\n　　福", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202603/t20260316_2194542.htm", "docreltime": "2026.03.16 08:26:00", "doctitle": "福建省人民政府办公厅印发《关于加力促进中小微企业高质量发展若干措施》的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2403811, "sourcename": "福建省人民政府门户网站", "subdoctitle": "闽政办〔2026〕8号", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202603/t20260316_2194542.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202603/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2194540, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "惠企政策", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202603/t20260316_2194540.htm", "content": "各省、自治区、直辖市工业和信息化主管部门：\n　　为贯彻党的二十大和二十届历次全会精神，落实党中央、国务院关于人工智能发展的决策部署，按照部党组工作要求，探索工业数据“采”“集”“用”有效路径，现启动工业", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/shfgfggyhyshj/hqzc_21977/202603/t20260316_2194540.htm", "docreltime": "2026.03.16 08:22:00", "doctitle": "工业和信息化部办公厅关于启动工业数据筑基行动 开展面向人工智能赋能的高质量行业数据集建设先行先试的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubda